B.Tg=new A.bO(B.TP,["Chat rooms like the good old days.\nCome in, pick your nickname and start chatting.","Your nickname","E.g.: Mario","START CHATTING","SIGN IN TO MY ACCOUNT","Create account","Your account password","Your account email","Forgot your password?","Resend confirmation","This nickname has an account. Enter your password.","Type your password.","Could not check that nickname. Try again.","Something went wrong.","Reset password","We will email your account address a link to create a new password.","We will resend your account confirmation email.","For security and moderation, we record the IP address of your connection.","Send","Cancel","Link sent to {email}. Check your inbox and spam folder.","Confirmation resent to {email}. Check your inbox and spam folder.","Choose your nickname","Your nickname","Nickname (unique, it gets reserved)","CONTINUE","Create account","Email","Password","Show password","Hide password","CREATE ACCOUNT","Creating\u2026","That nickname is already taken. Try another one.","Already have an account? Sign out and sign in with it","New password","Type your new password. You will use it together with your nickname to sign in.","New password","Repeat the new password","SAVE PASSWORD","Saving\u2026","The two passwords do not match.","Use at least 8 characters.","Password updated. Now sign in with your nickname and your new password.","GO TO THE SIGN-IN SCREEN","The email limit was reached for now: the email service at this stage is very small. Wait a few minutes and try again; your nickname is safe.","That email already has an account. Sign in with your nickname and password; if you have not confirmed the email yet, request a resend from the password step.","Your email is not confirmed yet. Check your inbox (and spam folder) or resend the confirmation.","Incorrect email or password.","Incorrect nickname or password.","That password is too weak: use at least 8 characters.","That email does not look valid. Check it and try again.","Something went wrong. Try again in a moment.",'Account created. We sent you a confirmation email: open it and tap the link (you will return to the app). Then sign in and your nickname "{nick}" will be reserved in your name automatically. If that email was not yours, do not confirm anything: that nickname will stay free.',"Your account is in. Your nickname is missing: it will be unique and reserved for you.",'This link was already used or has expired. Request a new one: on the sign-in screen type your nickname, tap "START CHATTING" and then "Forgot your password?".',"That nickname is already in use. Sign in and choose another.","Could not create the account.","Could not create the guest session.","Use 3 to 20 characters: letters, numbers or underscore.","United States","Canada","Spain","Dominican Republic","Other","Conversation created","General","Rooms","Private","Status","Profile","Error loading rooms: {error}","You already have 6 rooms open. Close one to open another.","Platform","Latino","North America","Europe","Thematic","Run by the Staff","Regional room","Thematic room","Could not open the General room.","Go to rooms","Your Status room is quiet.\nMentions, whispers, private messages and notices will arrive here.","You were mentioned in a room","You received a whisper","New private message","Someone added you as a favorite","One of your favorites came in","Moderation notice","System notice","{target} was automatically muted in {room} for posting a non-allowed link: {minutes} min (infraction no. {n}).","{actor} {verb} {target} in {room}.","User report: {reporter} reported {target}.","Error report sent by {reporter}.","ABUSE OF POWER report against {target} (owner only).","Your message in {room} was not posted: only YouTube links are allowed in rooms. You were muted for {minutes} min.","Guest","Registered account","ONEchat owner","ONEchat Staff","Global moderator","Your nickname color","App theme","System","Dark","Light","Language","Your bio","SAVE PROFILE","Saving\u2026","Profile saved.","Your country","Country","Blocked users","You haven't blocked anyone.","Unblock","My web page","Show in the Community","Your public page on the official site, with your Gallery.","View my web page","My Gallery","Up to 3 free photos \xb7 Premium: unlimited","Add photo","You reached the 3 free photos. Premium will allow unlimited uploads.","Uploading\u2026","Photo published to your Gallery.","Gallery","Delete photo","View page","Sign out","Privacy & contact","Direct messages open","If you turn this off, only people YOU have as favorites can message you.","Accept whispers","If you turn this off, nobody can whisper to you in rooms, except your favorites.","System notices in rooms","Who joins and leaves, plus mutes and bans (never showing the punished nickname).","Change my nickname","Change nickname","New nickname","3 to 20 characters: letters, numbers and underscore. You can only change it once every 7 days; your old messages keep the nickname they were written with.","Nickname changed. Hi, {nick}!","That nickname is already taken.","Invalid nickname: use 3 to 20 letters, numbers or underscore.","That is already your nickname.","You changed your nickname recently: you can change it again in a few days (7-day limit).","Could not change the nickname.","User","Global team","Only the owner can grant or remove global roles. Changes are recorded in the audit log.","Search by nickname (min. 2 letters)","No results.","Change role of {nick}","Role of {nick} updated to {role}.","Could not change the role.","Set {nick} as {role}?","Mention","{nick} joined","{nick} left","A user was muted in this room","A user was banned from this room","This user has direct messages closed.","This user does not accept whispers.","Delete my account","Delete your account?","This permanently deletes your profile, your messages, your Gallery photos and your conversations. Your nickname will be released. This cannot be undone.","This permanently deletes your guest profile, your messages and your conversations. This cannot be undone.","Your password","DELETE FOREVER","The password does not match.","The account could not be deleted. Try again.","Your account was deleted. Thanks for being part of ONEchat.","Public room","{n} online","Who's in the room","Room moderation","In the room ({n})","It's just you for now.","Room owner","Moderator","Featured","Be the first to say hi.","Type a message\u2026 (@nickname mentions)","Type a whisper\u2026","Whispering to {nick} \u2014 only they can see it","Cancel whisper","Send","Could not send: {e}","Could not whisper: {e}","You whisper to {nick}: ","{nick} whispers to you: ","  (you)","You are banned from this room","Room moderation removed your access. You can keep using the rest of ONEchat.","Back to rooms","You are muted in this room until {time}. You can read, but not write.","You are muted\u2026","Translate","Help room \xb7 Staff alerts","Play Tic-Tac-Toe","{nick} invited you to play Tic-Tac-Toe","Invitation sent \xb7 waiting for a reply\u2026","Accept","Decline","Cancel","Your turn","{nick}'s turn","You won! \ud83c\udf89","{nick} won","Draw \ud83e\udd1d","Rematch","Close","Resign","You are {mark}","Vs {nick} \xb7 You {w} \u2014 {l} \xb7 Draws {d}","Game invitation","{from} sent you a private message","{from} mentioned you in {room}","{from} whispered to you in {room}","{from} invited you to play Tic-Tac-Toe","Safety L{level}: suspicious activity by {from} in {room}","Safety L{level}: suspicious activity by {from} in a private chat","Safety L{level}: suspicious activity detected","Show original","This message is already in your language.","Could not translate right now. Try again.","Watch together","Invite to watch a video together","Paste the YouTube link","Send invitation","That link is not from YouTube.","Watch together is a Premium feature.","{nick} invites you to watch a video together","Accept","Decline","Waiting for {nick} to accept the invitation\u2026","Cancel","End","Watching together with {nick}","Invitation sent","Could not send the invitation.","{nick} invited you to Watch together","Copy","Message copied","Chat sounds","Plays when sending, receiving and being mentioned","Vibrate when mentioned","Where the device allows it (limited on iPhone web)","Room moderation","Active sanctions","None. The room is calm.","Banned from the room","Muted (active sanction)","Lift ban","Lift mute","Action log","No actions recorded yet.","muted","unmuted","banned","unbanned","kicked","featured","unfeatured","changed the role of","Last connection: {ip} \xb7 {when}","Platform ban (exile)","Ban from platform","Blocks their account, this device and their current IP at once. Changing IP will not let them back in.","Duration","24 hours","7 days","30 days","Permanent (owner only)","Reason (required, it is recorded)","E.g.: repeated threats and harassment","APPLY BAN","Ban applied: {n} layers blocked.","Could not apply the ban.","Active platform bans","Lift","Ban lifted.","Account","Device","IP","until {when}","permanent","by {nick}","Access revoked","Your access to ONEchat was revoked by the moderation team.","Your access to ONEchat was revoked by the moderation team until {when}.","If you believe this is a mistake, write to support@getonechat.com.","Sign out","Private message","Whisper","Favorite","Is your favorite","Block","Report","Block user","You will stop seeing {nick}'s messages. You can unblock them from your profile.","Block","User blocked.","Report user","Report reason","Briefly describe what happened","Send report","Report sent. Thank you.","Report","Report","What do you want to report?","Report a bug","Something in the app is not working","Report a user","Harassment, spam, impersonation, inappropriate content","Report abuse of power","Someone with power misused their privileges","Report a bug","Report a user","Report abuse of power","Describe what happened","Use your own words; the evidence is attached automatically","The last 30 messages of the room will be attached automatically as evidence, so you do not have to prove anything.","Their last 20 moderation actions will be attached automatically as evidence. Only the owner of ONEchat can see this report.","It will be sent together with the place in the app where you are now.","Who are you reporting?","Who misused their power?","Pick the room where it happened","There is no one to report here.","Send report","Report sent. Thanks for looking out for the community.","The report could not be sent. Please try again.","You are reporting","Report center","Report center","No reports to review.","New","In review","Resolved","Dismissed","Bug","User","Abuse of power","Reported by: {name}","Reported: {name}","Room: {name}","Evidence: latest messages in the room","Evidence: moderation actions","No evidence attached.","Mark in review","Resolve","Dismiss","Closing note","What was done or why the case is closed","Closed by {name}","All","New","In review","Closed","Report updated.","The report could not be updated.","Code of conduct for power holders","You hold a role with power in ONEchat. To receive it and keep it you must know and accept this code:","1. Power is a service, not a privilege. It exists to care for the room and the community, never for personal benefit, revenge or showing off.\n\n2. Every sanction needs a real reason and is recorded. If there is no reason that can be written down, there is no sanction.\n\n3. Proportionality: the smallest sanction that solves the problem. Warn first; the maximum punishment is the last resort, not the first.\n\n4. Nothing personal: sanctioning over arguments, jealousy, rivalries or private matters is forbidden. If you are part of a conflict, you do not moderate it: Staff or the room owner handles it.\n\n5. Privacy is sacred: the data that power lets you see (IP addresses, connection logs, reports) is used only for moderation. Publishing, sharing or using it outside the platform is the gravest fault.\n\n6. No favoritism: the rules apply equally to friends, favorites and acquaintances as to strangers.\n\n7. Public example: power holders communicate with respect in the rooms; their conduct is the showcase of the community.","If power is abused","Faults are punished on a ladder, applied by the global owner (and by the room owner for faults in their room): 1) private warning conversation, 2) formal recorded warning, 3) role suspension for 7 to 30 days, 4) permanent removal of the role, and 5) Banishment (Destierro), only for the gravest faults such as doxxing, harassment from power or extortion. You can always appeal to the owner.\n\nGolden rule: whoever abuses power loses power.","I accept the code of conduct","I will do it later","View the code of conduct","Cancel","Confirm","Yes, apply","This user is banned from this room.","This user is currently muted.","Ban","Lift ban","Mute","Lift mute","Kick","Feature","Remove feature","Make moderator","Remove moderator","Ban {nick} from this room? They will not be able to enter or write.","Kick {nick} from the room? They can come back in.","Mute {nick}","10 minutes","1 hour","24 hours","Muted for {dur}","Moderation action applied.","Could not apply it (check your permissions).","{nick} is now a room {role}.","moderator","member","Could not change the role.","Private conversation","Type a private message\u2026","Say hi to {nick}: only you two can see this conversation.","You: ","Error loading private chats: {e}",'You have no private conversations yet.\nEnter a room, tap someone\'s name and choose "Private message".',"Today"],t.li)
